OL,3,GNEWSAPhotos reveal The Smiths'
OL,4,A'dramatic' Manchester farewell
OL,5,
OL,6,FManchester's Free Trade Hall has a
OL,7,Fspecial place in music history, as the
OL,8,Fvenue - now a hotel - hosted some
OL,9,Flandmark moments.
OL,11,FIt was where an electric
OL,12,Fguitar-wielding Bob Dylan famously
OL,13,Ffaced an accusation of "Judas!" from a
OL,14,Fdisgruntled folk fan, where the Sex
OL,15,FPistols inspired some of the city's
OL,16,Fmost famous bands and the legendary
OL,17,FFactory Records, and where rock giants
OL,18,FKiss made their UK debut.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,410,400,260,160,0,100
