OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F409A1794254130
OL,1,W5j 5Q7kj 5j js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAPhotos reveal The Smiths'
OL,4,A'dramatic' Manchester farewell
OL,5,
OL,6,FAnd it was where The Smiths, one of
OL,7,FManchester's most iconic bands, played
OL,8,Fwhat would prove to be their final
OL,9,Ffarewell to the city on 30 October
OL,10,F1986.
OL,12,FForty years on, rarely-seen photos of
OL,13,Fthe show, taken by then-student Alison
OL,14,FBell show what she said was a
OL,15,F"dramatic" and "amazing" night.
